Package webdavclient3 provides an easy way to work with WebDAV servers.
It implements a Webdav API (check, free, info, list, mkdir, clean, copy,
move, download, upload, publish, unpublish) and a higher-level, object-
oriented Resource API for working with cloud storage resources.

Based on the original webdav-client-python but uses requests instead
of PyCURL.
